@startuml implementation01
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam monochrome true

title Implementation View - Level 1


rectangle "Port Management System" as PMS {
  [Web Application\n(SPA)] as SPA
  [Backend/OEM Services\n(.NET Core/node.js)] as Backend
  [Databases\n(SQL/MongoDB on Debian Server)] as DB

  SPA -down-> Backend : REST/HTTPS
  Backend -down-> DB : SQL/Mongo
}

rectangle "Identity Provider\n(Google/Microsoft/Facebook)" as IDP
rectangle "Email Service" as Email


Backend --> IDP : Auth0
Backend --> Email : SMTP

note right of PMS
  Technology Stack:
  - Frontend: React + Three.js
  - Backend: .NET Core 8.0 + node + Prolog
  - Database: PostgreSQL/MongoDB Server
  - Deployment: Docker containers
end note

note left of IDP
  External authentication
  supports multiple providers
end note

@enduml